WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.242
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind more communication

00:00:05.242 --> 00:00:05.747
technologies.

00:00:06.617 --> 00:00:11.755
Sensor: detects a change such as temperature or movement. Smart device: can use

00:00:11.755 --> 00:00:13.337
connected data to act.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:19.388
Network: allows devices to exchange information. Automated irrigation: can water

00:00:19.388 --> 00:00:25.095
crops based on programmed rules. Security: protects connected devices and their

00:00:25.095 --> 00:00:25.613
information.

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:31.442
Design a simple paper model explaining sensor, smart device and network. Trade models

00:00:31.442 --> 00:00:34.898
with a classmate and explain how your design works.
